=You are helping a sales team triage cold email replies.

Given the email body below, respond with ONLY valid JSON, no markdown formatting, no preamble:

{
  "classification": "Interested" | "Question" | "Objection" | "Not Interested" | "Auto-Reply",
  "confidence": 0-100,
  "reasoning": "one sentence",
  "suggested_reply": "a brief, natural 2-3 sentence reply draft, or empty string if not actionable"
}

Email body:
{{ $json.body }}

